; CAMPAIGN (WR-spec1-38, 65): the hearth raid and the Last Hearth herd. HearthRaid rings 28 m round the fire (no markers).
; The calmed herd's two strays lie by the fire once the choice is made; the Hearth's ground is a levelled pad, so no tilt.

